                <pb facs="0408" n="320" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg320"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/3080: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Argentina</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >White</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-05-10T16:00:00-04:00">May 10, 1933—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 4:02 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>39. At diplomatic reception yesterday Minister for Foreign Affairs expressed
                    himself as averse to the Argentine Government taking any further mediatory steps
                    in Chaco dispute at the present time.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">White</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
